WEBVTT

00:02:58.261 --> 00:03:03.122
(Beatboxanje)

00:03:03.146 --> 00:03:04.297
ili --

00:03:04.321 --> 00:03:10.017
(Beatboxanje)

00:03:10.041 --> 00:03:11.868
To su bili jednostavni ritmovi.

00:03:11.892 --> 00:03:16.294
Al' sad' imate ekipu koja hoće
raditi sve i svašta

00:03:16.318 --> 00:03:17.535
s ritmovima,

00:03:17.559 --> 00:03:19.948
i žele poniziti svog oca,

00:03:19.972 --> 00:03:23.222
što nije baš u redu kad
želite poniziti osobu

00:03:23.246 --> 00:03:26.112
koja se brinula o vama, plaćala
školarinu, (Nicole se smije)

00:03:26.136 --> 00:03:28.523
pogotovo kad imate 50 milijuna ljudi

00:03:28.547 --> 00:03:30.664
koji vas čisto fore radi
zovu "luzerom".